Submission log: one "DCSVR submission:" line at a session's first frame and whenever it changes, with every layer
the frame goes out with: its type, flags (source-alpha, unpremultiplied, ...), and per view the swapchain's format
(the DXGI number on D3D11, as in the "DCSVR two layers: ... swapchain" lines), array size, slice and rectangle. The
formats come from the application's swapchains and the layer's own (the composited output, the two-layer outputs).
